1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:08,797
Hello and welcome to the Owl's Lessons! Last time, you discovered online games, the rankings and ELO.

2
00:00:09,994 --> 00:00:15,833
Today, we go beyond one-on-one: tournaments, clubs and lessons with a teacher.

3
00:00:15,533 --> 00:00:18,886
Backgammon is better with others. Let's go!

4
00:00:21,509 --> 00:00:25,577
On TickGammon, everything starts from the app's home screen.

5
00:00:25,277 --> 00:00:31,858
Two buttons are waiting for you there: Events and Lessons. Your club, meanwhile, is in your profile.

6
00:00:32,211 --> 00:00:35,658
Events are the tournaments. Clubs are your community.

7
00:00:35,358 --> 00:00:39,042
And Lessons are there to help you improve with a teacher.

8
00:00:40,198 --> 00:00:45,870
To get started, all you need is an account, in your browser, on Android or on Windows.

9
00:00:47,829 --> 00:00:49,862
Let's start with tournaments.

10
00:00:49,562 --> 00:00:57,749
On TickGammon, tournaments are created by the board members of a club or a clan: the president, the vice-president or the secretary.

11
00:00:57,899 --> 00:01:03,478
It can be public, open to the whole community, or private, for your friends or your club.

12
00:01:03,861 --> 00:01:09,145
The organiser chooses the entry: free, or in TGC, the game's currency.

13
00:01:08,845 --> 00:01:12,207
And moderators can help run the tournament.

14
00:01:12,919 --> 00:01:18,715
If a tournament is cancelled before the end, entries are refunded. Nobody loses anything.

15
00:01:20,936 --> 00:01:24,403
Next, you need to choose the format. There are three.

16
00:01:24,553 --> 00:01:31,858
The first is direct elimination, like in tennis. Each round, a single match: win, and you move on.

17
00:01:31,558 --> 00:01:33,287
Lose, and it's over.

18
00:01:33,837 --> 00:01:41,006
The second is round robin. Nobody is eliminated: everyone plays everyone else, just like a real league.

19
00:01:42,098 --> 00:01:44,357
And the third is the Swiss system.

20
00:01:44,057 --> 00:01:49,369
One match per round, and each round, you face an opponent with the same results as you.

21
00:01:52,330 --> 00:01:55,769
Now, tournament day. There are two ways to play.

22
00:01:56,283 --> 00:02:00,117
In a tournament with deadlines, each round has its own end date.

23
00:01:59,817 --> 00:02:06,247
You challenge your opponent when you are both available, and a reminder arrives two days before the round ends.

24
00:02:08,681 --> 00:02:12,493
In a live tournament, everything is played on the same evening.

25
00:02:12,193 --> 00:02:15,503
Each round, you have a few minutes to join your table.

26
00:02:15,203 --> 00:02:18,625
In TickGammon's official tournaments, it's five minutes.

27
00:02:20,064 --> 00:02:26,552
Be careful: if your opponent is there and you are not, they win the match. So stay close to your screen!

28
00:02:26,252 --> 00:02:32,204
And every Friday at eight p.m., don't miss the Friday Cup, the official tournament of the week.

29
00:02:35,468 --> 00:02:42,201
Now let's talk about clubs. A club brings together players who meet often, online or around a real table.

30
00:02:43,471 --> 00:02:48,093
There are also clans: the same idea, but for friends who mostly play online.

31
00:02:49,363 --> 00:02:55,132
Want to create your own? Send a request from the app. Once it's approved, you become its president.

32
00:02:55,435 --> 00:03:01,328
The club has its own news feed for announcements, and its events: meetings, training, matches…

33
00:03:01,028 --> 00:03:03,946
Every member gets a reminder the day before.

34
00:03:07,667 --> 00:03:10,968
A club is also a place to compete with fellow members.

35
00:03:11,227 --> 00:03:18,545
There's an internal ranking, a monthly challenge with free TGC when you reach the goal, and a hall of fame to keep track of the wins.

36
00:03:20,206 --> 00:03:26,141
Official clubs can even challenge each other, for one to seven days: it's the clan war!

37
00:03:27,870 --> 00:03:37,673
And loyalty is rewarded: after one month, six months, then on every anniversary in the club, you receive free TGC, based on how long you've been a member.

38
00:03:39,573 --> 00:03:44,808
Now for the lessons. Teachers offer live backgammon lessons for all levels.

39
00:03:46,796 --> 00:03:53,477
Every teacher is approved by the TickGammon team and holds a grade: Amateur, Expert or Confirmed.

40
00:03:54,517 --> 00:03:59,391
In the lesson calendar, you choose a time slot and book your place. Lesson full?

41
00:03:59,091 --> 00:04:03,164
Join the waiting list: you'll be told as soon as a place opens up.

42
00:04:04,945 --> 00:04:07,527
Before the lesson, reminders let you know.

43
00:04:07,227 --> 00:04:11,114
And some lessons have a replay, so you can watch them again later.

44
00:04:13,628 --> 00:04:17,585
Would you rather have a lesson just for you? Choose a private lesson.

45
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:24,338
You choose your teacher, you ask for a time slot, and they reply within forty-eight hours.

46
00:04:24,038 --> 00:04:29,449
Lessons paid in TGC, group or private, are open to everyone, with no pack needed.

47
00:04:29,149 --> 00:04:32,477
Only free group lessons require the Wisdom Pack.

48
00:04:33,637 --> 00:04:40,175
And if you're a strong player who loves to teach, you can become a teacher yourself, with the Chouette Pack.

49
00:04:39,875 --> 00:04:44,795
Send your application from your account: level, club, experience and motivation.

50
00:04:46,391 --> 00:04:49,159
The team reviews it and replies by email.

51
00:04:48,859 --> 00:04:55,902
Then you set your time slots and your prices in TGC, and you receive ninety percent of the TGC from each lesson.

52
00:04:58,786 --> 00:05:09,147
And there you go, you now know how to play with others: create a tournament, choose its format, join your table on time, bring a club to life, and improve with a teacher!

53
00:05:09,297 --> 00:05:16,600
To get started, play for free against other players or against the computer, in your browser, on Android or on Windows.

54
00:05:16,300 --> 00:05:22,250
Next time, I'll tell you about jacquet, trictrac and backgammon. Subscribe so you don't miss it!

55
00:05:21,950 --> 00:05:24,015
See you soon around the board!

